+} p;
+
+// Select weight block type via preprocessor define (1=Q8_0, 2=Q4_0, 3=Q4_K, 4=Q6_K, 5=Q5_K).
+// Compiled separately per type by vulkan-shaders-gen (see process_shaders()).
